# Keep host build output and tooling out of the image build context: the Dockerfiles restore and
# build from source, and a Windows obj/ tree in the context makes `COPY . .` slow and can poison
# the Linux restore.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/TestResults/
**/BenchmarkDotNet.Artifacts/
**/node_modules/
.git/
.github/
.claude/
.idea/
.vs/
docs/
*.md
!README.md

# Agent skills are content, not documentation: the API image serves them from its content root.
!skills/
